{"ticker":{"symbol":"000540.KS","name":"흥국화재","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":3100.0,"change_pct":0.0,"market_cap":199152189440.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":2870.0,"week52_high":7480.0,"sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"South Korea","city":"Seoul","employees":null,"website":"https://www.heungkukfire.co.kr","business_summary":"Heungkuk Fire&Marine Insurance Co., Ltd. engages in non-life insurance business. The company offers medical/health, children's, driver/accident, pension/savings, fire/property, car, and travel insurance products; and marine and special insurance, as well as long-term damage such as disease, injury, and property damage. It also provides loan products; and engages in reinsurance business. The company was formerly known as Heungkuk Ssangyong Fire & Marine Insurance Co., Ltd. and changed its name to Heungkuk Fire&Marine Insurance Co., Ltd. in 2009. Heungkuk Fire&Marine Insurance Co., Ltd. was founded in 1948 and is headquartered in Seoul, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"흥국화재해상보험(주)는 손해보험업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 의료/건강, 아동, 운전자/사고, 연금/저축, 화재/재산, 자동차 및 여행 보험 상품을 제공합니다. 해상보험 및 특별보험은 물론 질병, 부상, 재산 피해 등 장기 피해까지 보장합니다. 또한 대출 상품도 제공합니다. 재보험 사업을 영위하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 이전에 흥국쌍용화재보험주식회사로 알려졌으나 2009년에 흥국화재해상보험주식회사로 상호를 변경했습니다. 흥국화재해상보험주식회사는 1948년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 서울에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"손해보험","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":2552542000000.0,"operating_income":null,"net_income":207243000000.0,"eps":3053.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":2859729000000.0,"operating_income":null,"net_income":295540000000.0,"eps":4389.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":2753590000000.0,"operating_income":null,"net_income":106722000000.0,"eps":1439.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":3013338000000.0,"operating